<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 15 bln yen 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 15 bln yen 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sumitomo Finance International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN YEN    COUPON   * 5.20	MATURITY    18.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	    * REDEMPTION IN US$ AT 4172.58 DOLLARS PER 500,000 YEN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
